nal-processing concepts"}]}]},{"heading":"Patient Safety Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Neurophysiology testing requires careful attention to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Correct patient identification"},{"text":"Accurate test request verification"},{"text":"Infection prevention"},{"text":"Electrode hygiene"},{"text":"Electrical safety"},{"text":"Patient comfort"},{"text":"Appropriate monitoring"},{"text":"Emergency preparedness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For EMG/NCS procedures, the technician must follow appropriate clinical protocols and immediately escalate adverse reactions or unexpected patient symptoms."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Professional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful additional learning areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic Life Support (BLS)"},{"text":"EEG fundamentals"},{"text":"Advanced EEG"},{"text":"EMG/NCS fundamentals"},{"text":"Evoked potentials"},{"text":"Sleep-study fundamentals"},{"text":"Neuro-monitoring"},{"text":"Infection prevention"},{"text":"Clinical neurophysiology"},{"text":"Digital signal processing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Hands-on supervised training is especially important because neuro-electrophysiology depends heavily on precise electrode placement, signal quality and standardized testing procedures."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate pathways include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Neurophysiology"},{"text":"M.Sc Neuro-Electrophysiology"},{"text":"M.Sc Neuroscience"},{"text":"M.Sc Clinical Neurophysiology-related programs"},{"text":"Master's in Allied Health Sciences"},{"text":"Clinical Research"},{"text":"Neuroscience Research"},{"text":"Healthcare Management"},{"text":"Hospital Administration"},{"text":"For a technical clinical pathway, advanced education in Neurophysiology/Neuro-Electrophysiology is the most directly aligned."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specia